text = "Basic is the premiere starting alien, lacking a default ability but becoming much easier to play and master. This makes Basic a perfect middle ground, with decent stats all around. It also makes Basic exceptional at performing various techs or tricks because of its lack of jank hitboxes or inconsistent factors. As a bonus, Basic also has a simple and easy to use ultimate ability.

Default - N/A

Ultimate - Boost
Charge: 500
Duration: 200
Basic gets 30% larger and 50% faster.
"
